flowchart LR
  PURPOSE["Purpose<br/>why the factory exists"] --> MISSION["Mission<br/>governed software delivery for teams"] --> VISION["Vision<br/>bounded delegation with human direction and authority"]
  VISION --> GOALS["Seven proposed strategic goals"]
  GOALS --> PRINCIPLES["Architecture principles<br/>AP-001 to AP-004"]
  PRINCIPLES --> ADRS["Accepted and proposed ADRs<br/>decision inventory preserves status"]
  ADRS --> CAPABILITIES["Owner-context capabilities and contracts<br/>pinned source revisions"]
  CAPABILITIES --> ISSUES["Typed source Issues<br/>in the owning repositories"]
  ISSUES --> PROJECTS["GitHub Projects<br/>proposed planning and progress surface"]
  GOALS --> QUALITY["Quality scenarios and measures<br/>baselines remain unmeasured until evidenced"]
  QUALITY --> EVALUATION["Evaluation evidence<br/>synthetic, pending, or observed"]
  ISSUES --> EVALUATION
  EVALUATION --> FINDINGS["Reviewed finding or product outcome"]
  FINDINGS --> ISSUES
  PROJECTS -. "prioritizes; never authorizes execution" .-> ISSUES
  AUTHORITY["Maintainers retain adoption, priority, review, merge, release, and activation authority"]
  AUTHORITY -. "reviews proposals and evidence" .-> GOALS
  STATUS["Proposal status: no Project or product repository is confirmed; fixture evidence is synthetic"]
  STATUS -.-> PROJECTS
  STATUS -.-> EVALUATION
